  "approval": {
    "status": "tool-fixture-only",
    "source": "ENG-P008-014 frozen finite contract: actual builder places 1000-credit L1 factory, 600-credit mech, HP500 and 23 direct damage; independent Float32 .0012 reaches 1 after 834 updates, production starts at1200 and birth2033. Literal exit277,149 heading180. No original compatibility claim. The target is an armed mech: PlayerControl.NONE only disables commands, not autonomous weapons. Both HP500 mechs require 22 hits of23; this self-scenario checks both actual deaths, including in-flight shots after a source dies. The earlier survival assertion was an author contract error, not a product regression."
  },
  "exclusions": [
    "original-compatibility",
    "platform-input",
    "performance"
  ],
  "constructedUnits": [
